{
  "schema_version": 2,
  "id": "smart.confirm-change",
  "version": "1.3.0",
  "title": "Change confirmation",
  "summary": "A prepared change put to a person: each value as it was and as it will be, two answers of equal weight, until when it can be answered, and then only the outcome. Applies nothing; a press is an event.",
  "kind": "smart",
  "reuse_mode": "whole",
  "lifecycle": "experimental",
  "tags": [
    "confirmation",
    "change",
    "diff",
    "chat"
  ],
  "capabilities": [
    "confirmation",
    "expiry",
    "live-announcement"
  ],
  "custom_element": "sf-confirm-change",
  "templates": [
    "default"
  ],
  "exported_parts": [],
  "composition": {
    "uses": [
      "smart.button",
      "smart.icon"
    ],
    "public_parts": []
  },
  "inputs": {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
      "template": {
        "type": "string",
        "default": "default",
        "description": "Template variant name for SfBaseElement external templates.",
        "const": "default"
      },
      "root-class": {
        "type": "string",
        "default": "",
        "description": "Classes added to the root element the component draws."
      },
      "root-style": {
        "type": "string",
        "default": "",
        "description": "Inline style declarations set on the root element the component draws, custom properties included."
      },
      "heading": {
        "type": "string",
        "default": "",
        "description": "What the change is; without one the card is named «What will change»."
      },
      "heading-level": {
        "type": "string",
        "default": "3",
        "description": "The heading's level where the card is placed.",
        "enum": [
          "2",
          "3",
          "4",
          "5",
          "6"
        ]
      },
      "state": {
        "type": "string",
        "default": "open",
        "description": "open: the answers are offered. pending: an answer is on its way (set by a press). accepted, declined, expired: only the outcome is shown.",
        "enum": [
          "open",
          "pending",
          "accepted",
          "declined",
          "expired"
        ]
      },
      "expires-at": {
        "type": "string",
        "default": "",
        "description": "ISO 8601. Past it an open card reads as expired and says so once with sf-change-confirm-expired."
      },
      "change-id": {
        "type": "string",
        "default": "",
        "description": "The host's name for the change, carried back in every event."
      },
      "disabled": {
        "type": "boolean",
        "default": false,
        "description": "The answers are shown and cannot be pressed (a send is in flight elsewhere)."
      },
      "accept-text": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "The accepting answer; empty is Confirm in the page's language."
      },
      "decline-text": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "The declining answer; empty is Decline in the page's language."
      },
      "changes": {
        "type": "array",
        "default": [],
        "description": "The values, as JSON in markup; a property set from script wins.",
        "items": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "label": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "What changes (a field's name)."
            },
            "before": {
              "type": [
                "string",
                "number",
                "null"
              ],
              "description": "The value as it is; empty or null reads as empty."
            },
            "after": {
              "type": [
                "string",
                "number",
                "null"
              ],
              "description": "The value as it will be."
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "label"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "additionalProperties": false
  },
  "item_contract": {},
  "contracts": {
    "change": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "label": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "What changes (a field's name)."
        },
        "before": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "number",
            "null"
          ],
          "description": "The value as it is; empty or null reads as empty."
        },
        "after": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "number",
            "null"
          ],
          "description": "The value as it will be."
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "label"
      ]
    },
    "answers": {
      "const": "A press moves the card to pending and dispatches sf-change-confirm-answer {id, accepted} (cancelable). A cancelled event returns it to open. The host sets the outcome: accepted, declined, or open again when the answer could not be delivered. The card never applies anything."
    },
    "slots": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "description": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "A line under the heading (a code, who proposed it)."
        }
      }
    },
    "css_variables": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "--sf-change-confirm-radius": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "--sf-change-confirm-inset": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "--sf-change-confirm-gap": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "--sf-change-confirm-before-background-color": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "--sf-change-confirm-after-background-color": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "--sf-change-confirm-after-color": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "methods": {
    "open": {
      "summary": "Puts the question again; asked by an assembly it answers {accepted, reason, value} when the person answers or the time runs out.",
      "arguments": [],
      "returns": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "{outcome: applied} or {outcome: refused, reason}"
      }
    },
    "answer": {
      "summary": "Answer as the person would: accepted true confirms, false declines. Refused closed, disabled or prevented. answer('accept') and answer('decline') are read until 2026-12-01.",
      "arguments": [
        {
          "name": "accepted",
          "schema": {
            "type": "boolean"
          }
        }
      ],
      "returns": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "{outcome: applied} or {outcome: refused, reason}"
      }
    },
    "confirm": {
      "summary": "The acceptance; data-sf-action=\"<id>.confirm\".",
      "arguments": [],
      "returns": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "{outcome: applied} or {outcome: refused, reason}"
      }
    },
    "cancel": {
      "summary": "The declining answer; data-sf-action=\"<id>.cancel\".",
      "arguments": [],
      "returns": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "{outcome: applied} or {outcome: refused, reason}"
      }
    }
  },
  "events": {
    "sf-confirm-change-answer": {
      "summary": "The person answered (vocabulary answer). Cancel it to keep the question open. The 1.0 names sf-change-confirm-accept and -decline follow it until 2026-12-01.",
      "payload": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "id",
          "accepted"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "description": "change-id"
          },
          "accepted": {
            "type": "boolean"
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": true
      },
      "canonical": true
    },
    "sf-confirm-change-expired": {
      "summary": "An open card passed expires-at; said once per time. The 1.0 name sf-change-confirm-expire follows it until 2026-12-01.",
      "payload": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "id"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "description": "change-id"
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": true
      },
      "canonical": true
    },
    "sf-change-confirm-accept": {
      "summary": "Dated alias of sf-change-confirm-answer until 2026-12-01 (detail-adds).",
      "payload": {
        "type": "object"
      },
      "alias_of": "sf-confirm-change-answer"
    },
    "sf-change-confirm-decline": {
      "summary": "Dated alias of sf-change-confirm-answer until 2026-12-01 (detail-adds).",
      "payload": {
        "type": "object"
      },
      "alias_of": "sf-confirm-change-answer"
    },
    "sf-change-confirm-expire": {
      "summary": "Dated alias of sf-change-confirm-expired until 2026-12-01 (same-detail).",
      "payload": {
        "type": "object"
      },
      "alias_of": "sf-confirm-change-expired"
    },
    "sf-change-confirm-answer": {
      "summary": "Dated alias of sf-confirm-change-answer until 2027-01-01 (same-detail).",
      "payload": {
        "type": "object"
      },
      "alias_of": "sf-confirm-change-answer"
    },
    "sf-change-confirm-expired": {
      "summary": "Dated alias of sf-confirm-change-expired until 2027-01-01 (same-detail).",
      "payload": {
        "type": "object"
      },
      "alias_of": "sf-confirm-change-expired"
    }
  },
  "state": {
    "machines": {
      "answer": [
        "open",
        "pending",
        "accepted",
        "declined",
        "expired"
      ]
    },
    "visual_states": [
      "default",
      "loading",
      "success",
      "disabled"
    ]
  },
  "persistence": {
    "mode": "none",
    "source_of_truth": "host",
    "network_owner": "host",
    "revision_field": null
  },
  "ownership": {
    "source": "simai/ui-pro",
    "data": "host",
    "effects": "host",
    "forbidden_client_responsibilities": [
      "applying the change",
      "composing a command or a code for the server",
      "access decisions"
    ]
  },
  "security": {
    "permissions_owner": "host",
    "untrusted_inputs": [
      "heading, labels and values (drawn as text)"
    ],
    "network_policy": "deny"
  },
  "accessibility": {
    "role": "region",
    "accessible_name": "internal",
    "keyboard": [
      "Tab",
      "Enter",
      "Space"
    ],
    "focus": "A section named by its heading (role=heading at heading-level). The values are a description list. The status line is a polite live region, present before it speaks; when a press takes the answers away, focus moves to it instead of falling to the page, and back to the first answer when the host cancels."
  },
  "presentation": {
    "themes": [
      "light",
      "dark"
    ],
    "locales": [
      "en",
      "ru"
    ],
    "responsive": [
      "desktop",
      "mobile"
    ],
    "skeleton": {
      "shape": "none",
      "while_loading": "none"
    }
  },
  "adapter": {
    "kind": "generic",
    "protocol": "simai.smart-studio-adapter.v1",
    "module": null
  },
  "artifacts": {
    "fixtures": [
      "studio.fixture.json"
    ],
    "scenarios": []
  },
  "readiness": {
    "level": "host-required",
    "required_checks": [
      "manifest",
      "loader-rule",
      "change-confirm-contract",
      "change-confirm-browser"
    ]
  },
  "compatibility": {
    "contract_schema": {
      "id": "https://simai.io/contracts/smart-component-manifest.v2.schema.json",
      "version": 2
    },
    "runtime_pair": {
      "ui_revision": "89834691fb9dce692be5353f3214df7aee3a7e27",
      "ui_smart_revision": "89834691fb9dce692be5353f3214df7aee3a7e27"
    },
    "aliases": [
      "<sf-change-confirm>"
    ],
    "deprecations": [
      {
        "path": "<sf-change-confirm>",
        "since": "1.3.0",
        "replacement": "<sf-confirm-change>"
      }
    ],
    "replacement": null,
    "migrations": [
      {
        "from": "1.0.0",
        "to": "1.1.0",
        "changes": [
          "standard simai.smart-component 1.3.8: the element is made from component.json; dated aliases in aliases.json",
          "sf-change-confirm-accept -> sf-change-confirm-answer until 2026-12-01 (event)",
          "sf-change-confirm-decline -> sf-change-confirm-answer until 2026-12-01 (event)",
          "sf-change-confirm-expire -> sf-change-confirm-expired until 2026-12-01 (event)"
        ]
      },
      {
        "from": "1.2.0",
        "to": "1.2.1",
        "changes": [
          "The first-paint snapshot's sheets.json lists the utility sheets its markup uses (retaken on ui-source 5ba9399); no behaviour changed. Nothing to change for a host."
        ]
      },
      {
        "from": "1.2.3",
        "to": "1.2.4",
        "changes": [
          "The time a proposal stays open through core's format helpers; needs core.runtime >= 1.20.0. No visible change. Nothing to change for a host on a pair from core.runtime 1.20.0 on."
        ]
      },
      {
        "from": "1.2.4",
        "to": "1.3.0",
        "changes": [
          "The tag is sf-confirm-change (rename plan R2, naming decision 2026-11-02: sf-[set]-<block>); the folder confirm-change, the id smart.confirm-change and the bundle cl-confirm-change follow it (were change-confirm, smart.change-confirm, cl-change-confirm). sf-change-confirm stays a dated alias until 2027-01-01: old markup upgrades as this element, the Loader forwards cl-change-confirm, and every event fires under its former name as well, with the same detail. Public CSS variables and classes keep their names. Needs the SIMAI Framework pair whose package reference lists the former tag (core.runtime 1.22.0). Nothing to change for a host until 2027-01-01; new markup writes sf-confirm-change."
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "provenance": {
